PriceRoll "*" --> "1" ActualValue : /value
Ship "1" *-- "*" Cargo : hold {ordered}
Ship "1" *-$newArrow("2026-11-27c")- "*" Fare : fares {ordered}
Fare "*" -$newArrow("2026-11-27c")-> "1" World : from
Fare "*" -$newArrow("2026-11-27c")-> "1" Hex : to
Booking "*" -$newArrow("2026-11-27c")-> "0..1" Fare : forFare
Cargo --> CargoKind
